---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /oc_introduce/index.html
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
title: "Joe的个人小站 | 档案馆"
description: "Joe 的角色档案馆：角色、势力、技术与世界设定。"
canonical: "https://furryjoe.site/oc_introduce/"
pageTitle: "档案馆"
styles:
  - /css/html-style/oc_introduce.css
  - /css/animations/animation-oc_introduce.css
  - /css/mobile-adaption.css
headScripts:
  - /js/oc_introduce.js
---
<div class="CenterContainer">
    <div class="page-header">
    </div>
    <div id="oc_introduce_panel" class="cyber-frame">
        <button id="sidebar-toggle" class="cyber-control" type="button" aria-label="切换侧边栏" aria-controls="sidebar" aria-expanded="false">☰</button>
        <nav id="sidebar" class="cyber-frame" aria-label="档案目录">
            <ul id="title-list">
                {% for section in oc %}
                <li><a class="TextTitle cyber-control" href="#{{ section.anchor }}" data-anchor="{{ section.anchor }}">{{ section.title }}</a></li>
                {% endfor %}
            </ul>
        </nav>
        <div id="content-container" class="cyber-frame">
            <div id="output">
                {% for section in oc %}
                {# 旧正文是纯文本：保留段落和换行，不当作 HTML 解析。 #}
                <section id="{{ section.anchor }}" aria-labelledby="{{ section.anchor }}-title">
                    <h2 id="{{ section.anchor }}-title">{{ section.title }}</h2>
                    {% for paragraph in section.paragraphs %}
                    <p class="content-paragraph">{% for line in paragraph %}{{ line }}{% if not loop.last %}<br>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</p>
                    {% endfor %}
                </section>
                {% endfor %}
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
